        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Primate & mammalian cerebral cortex and white-matter tracts (Homo sapiens, Macaca mulatta, Pan troglodytes, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
