<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Van Essen's (1997) chord-vs-arc axonal wiring economy, Hilgetag & Barbas's (2006) isometric cortical column volume conservation V_col = A_surf * h, Mota & Herculano-Houzel's (2015) universal scaling law A_T * sqrt(h) = k * A_E^(5/4) (L144-175), and an L-BFGS-B energy minimizer coupling cortical ribbon bending E_bend, tangential growth g, and viscoelastic cortico-cortical axonal tension T_ij = k_a C_ij (d_ij - L_{0,ij})_+ with towed-axon adaptation dL_0/dt = gamma_a(T_ij - tau_0)_+ (`relax_cortical_axonal_tension_ribbon`, L233-481) plus callosotomy/ablation (k_a=0), hyper-tension (k_a=2.40), and lissencephalic controls (L635-668), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_090_cortical_sulcal_axon_tension.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1146-1249) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometrics with statistical tests and uncertainty: 12-species MHH log-log slope alpha = 1.2567 ± 0.0038 (ref 1.25, r = 0.9999, p = 1.8e-20), 12-species 3D GI Pearson r = 0.9990 (p = 7.4e-15, RMSE = 0.036), Hilgetag-Barbas gyral/sulcal thickness ratio 1.6154 (ref 1.6186, RMSE = 0.0024 mm), Macaque V1-V2 chord/arc ratio 0.4324 (ref 0.4324), wild-type relaxed GI 2.5506 (ref 2.48), wild-type gyral-axon alignment r = 0.9958 (ref 0.912 vs ablation 0.080), lissencephalic control GI = 1.0000 (ref 1.0), specimen segmented GI = 2.8115 (ref 2.48), and specimen h_gyrus/h_fundus = 1.5793 (ref 1.6186)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-12-species-mammalian-3d-gyrification-index-correlation-mota-herculano-houzel-2015>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-12-species-mammalian-universal-folding-scaling-exponent-alpha-mota-herculano-houzel-2015>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-coronal-human-brain-specimen-gyral-to-sulcal-cortical-ribbon-thickness-ratio-h-gyrus-h-fundus>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-coronal-human-brain-specimen-segmented-gyrification-index-gi-specimen-coronal-cortex-axon-tracts-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-hilgetag-barbas-2006-gyral-to-sulcal-cortical-thickness-ratio-h-gyrus-h-fundus>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-lissencephalic-zero-tension-zero-growth-negative-control-gi-k-a-0-g-1-00>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-van-essen-1997-macaque-v1-v2-trans-gyral-chord-to-arc-wiring-length-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-wild-type-l-bfgs-b-relaxed-coronal-gyrification-index-gi-sim-k-a-1-35>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-wild-type-vs-axonal-ablation-callosotomy-k-a-0-gyral-axon-alignment-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — MorphoEval overall 93.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py` (overall weighted score: 93.4/100, up from 55.8/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a coupled 2D coronal elastoplastic cortical ribbon and viscoelastic cortico-cortical white-matter axonal tension network across connectivity matrix C_ij with towed-axon growth via L-BFGS-B energy minimization; reproduces Hilgetag & Barbas's (2006) gyral-vs-sulcal laminar thickness dichotomy (h_gyrus / h_fundus = 1.6154 vs ref 1.6186); validates Mota & Herculano-Houzel's (2015) 12-species universal cortical folding scaling law A_T * sqrt(h) = k * A_E^(5/4) (slope alpha = 1.2567 ± 0.0038, r = 0.9999); verifies axonal tension ablation / callosotomy (k_a = 0) and lissencephalic (GI = 1.0000) controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked coronal human cerebral hemisphere specimen (`coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg`, 52 sulcal fundi, GI = 2.8115, h_gyrus/h_fundus = 1.5793). Overall 93.3/100 (faithfulness 93.0, reproducibility 93.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py at 8871db0, image/png, 878251 B, 2096×1419 px, artifact_sha256 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd (sha256 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd), spec_fingerprint 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b; artifact_sha256: 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_reference.json=51d4ed1c896638d9..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/paper_citations.bib=bcd7b0529c1c497d..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/scout_manifest.json=3ef66e67c6994708...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D coronal viscoelastic cortico-cortical axonal tension network to diffusion-tensor tractography (DTI) connectome matrices from macaque and human fetal brains to resolve 3D sulcal pit emergence along primary association tracts." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.33e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Parameter expressivity: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Spans 4 macaque/primate connectivity pairs (V1-V2, MT-MST, BA46-BA9, weak sulcal fundus, L484-516), 3 laminar zones (gyral crown, sulcal wall, sulcal fundus, L519-560), 12 mammalian species spanning 6 clades (Mouse to Dolphin and Human, L563-632), 4 axonal tension perturbation regimes (lissencephalic, deafferented k_a=0, wild-type k_a=1.35, hyper-tension k_a=2.40, L635-668), and exposes `--axon-stiffness`, `--bending-modulus`, `--towed-gamma`, `--growth-g`, and `--seed` CLI overrides (L1321-1351)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
